        "body": "## Outcome\nUnresolved combined target. The three-dimensional question remains open here. This package credits Benjamini–Kozma’s existing four-dimensional preprint, with an explicit caveat that its full proof and printed inconsistencies have not received a complete independent repair audit.\n\n## Included work\n- Exact original distance-ten, full-path marginal, and complete-range nonintersection scope\n- Standard finite matching/Hall-deficiency and compactness reduction, plus elementary bounds\n- Author exact checks and separate adversarial review, including 665 independent assertions\n- Full source-status and novelty qualifications; no new full solution claimed\n\nThe frozen mathematical artifact passed independent partial review without required corrections. Actual author and reviewer model: gpt-6-astra, xhigh.\n\nQueue disposition: unsolved. The campaign’s single queue writer will add that row update to this branch; this commit only touches this problem’s attempt folder.\n\nNo merge or release is requested.",
